# Tests

- Files: `test_*.py` under `tests/`, mirror `src/nlp_shap/` layout
- Absolute imports: `from nlp_shap...`
- Behavior tests over trivia / mock theater
- Markers: `bench` (local `make bench`), `lms`, `gpu` — skip when deps/host missing
- Agent default / `make check`: `pytest -m "not lms and not gpu and not bench"` (`make agent-check`)
- Full markers: `make tests-all`
- Hook helper tests (e.g. `tests/hooks/`) OK for tooling outside the package
